      "instance_name": "mental_disorder_stigma",
      "label": "Stigma associated with mental disorders",
      "description": "The meme relies on the real-world concept that mental disorders are often stigmatized, misunderstood, or trivialized in popular culture. The joke attempts to mock mental illness by reducing it to a childish game, which is harmful because it reinforces negative stereotypes and can contribute to societal prejudice against people with mental health conditions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
