        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_1908c537"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_1b69c9c3",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "general internet audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad online audience familiar with internet humor, pun-based memes, and pop culture references to mental health. It targets individuals who understand wordplay and may find absurd or ironic humor in the trivialization of serious topics like mental illness. The meme relies on the audience's awareness of mental health stigma and ableism, suggesting it is aimed at those who either ignore or mock such issues, or who are part of communities that engage with dark or edgy humor.",
